ns – as well as a percentage of the craft sales - is divided between St. Andrew’s Church and a local charity. Last year, thanks to your generosity, we were able to donate over 6,000, and we want to beat last year\'s total!  This year we are supporting the Alzheimer’s Society.  This illness affects so many people’s lives.  Please help us to raise as much as we can.\nIf you can donate any good books or bric-a-brac, please let us know. We are happy to collect locally.  Thank you.',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,50.375500,-4.142700,1687420,NULL,NULL,1,1,'Pending',0,NULL),(42,'2026-07-09 09:01:14','2035-08-25 13:14:51',NULL,NULL,'Email','MessageMaker','',NULL,'From: \"Test User\" <pw_mtmovemessage_mod@test.com>\nTo: \"pw_mtmovemessage@yahoogroups.com\" <pw_mtmovemessage@yahoogroups.com>\nSubject: OFFER: PW_mtmovemessage Pending Sofa (PL1 2EX)\nDate: Sat, 22 Aug 2035 13:14:51 +0000\nMessage-Id: <1783587674245912807160@pw-testenv>\nReply-To: \"Test User\" <pw_mtmovemessage_mod@test.com>\nUser-Agent: eM_Client/6.0.22344.0\nX-Mailer: Freegle Message Maker 2.7\nMime-Version: 1.0\nContent-Type: multipart/mixed; boundary=\"------=_MBBD231414-99C8-4563-B61D-69E50BE6FCD3\"\n\n\n--------=_MBBD231414-99C8-4563-B61D-69E50BE6FCD3\nContent-Type: multipart/alternative;\n boundary=\"------=_MB153ECA7E-06F3-462A-AF2C-D3E3B2A46538\"\n\n\n--------=_MB153ECA7E-06F3-462A-AF2C-D3E3B2A46538\nContent-Type: text/plain; format=flowed; charset=utf-8\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\n\nTest with 2 attachments\n\nAnd a line break.\n\nAt the beginning of August every year we hold a 3-day craft fair in St. Andrew’s Church, Penrith. The 2018 fair\nwill be the 7th. As well as local crafts we sell good quality second-hand books and bric-a-brac. All the\nproceed from the sale of these, plus proceeds from refreshments, raffles and competitions – as well as a percentage of the craft sales - is divided between St. Andrew’s Church and a local charity. Last year, thanks to your generosity, we were able to donate over 6,000, and we want to beat last year\'s total!  This year we are supporting the Alzheimer’s Society.  This illness affects so many people’s lives.  Please help us to raise as much as we can.\nIf you can donate any good books or bric-a-brac, please let us know. We are happy to collect locally.  Thank you.\n\n\n--------=_MB153ECA7E-06F3-462A-AF2C-D3E3B2A46538\nContent-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\n\n<HTML><HEAD>\n<STYLE id=3DeMClientCss>\nblockquote.cite { margin-left: 5px; margin-right: 0px; padding-left: 10px;=\n padding-right:0px; border-left: 1px solid #cccccc }\nblockquote.cite2 {margin-left: 5px; margin-right: 0px; padding-left: 10px;=\n padding-right:0px; border-left: 1px solid #cccccc; margin-top: 3px; paddin=\ng-top: 0px; }\n.plain pre, .plain tt { font-family: monospace; font-size: 100%; font-weigh=\nt: normal; font-style: normal; white-space: pre-wrap; }\na img { border: 0px; }body {font-family: Tahoma;font-size: 12pt;}\n.plain pre, .plain tt {font-family: Tahoma;font-size: 12pt;}</STYLE>\n</HEAD>\n<BODY>Test with 2 attachments</BODY></HTML>\n--------=_MB153ECA7E-06F3-462A-AF2C-D3E3B2A46538--\n\n--------=_MBBD231414-99C8-4563-B61D-69E50BE6FCD3\nContent-Type: image/png; name=g4g220x194.png\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: base64\nContent-Disposition: attachment; filename=g4g220x194.png\n\niVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAANwAAADCCAYAAAAihqxqAAAAAXNSR0IArs4c6QAAAAZiS0dEAP8A\n/wD/oL2nkwAAAAlwSFlzAAAuIwAALiMBeKU/dgAAAAd0SU1FB90HFg8sOyZAtLUAAB6nSURBVHja\n7Z15mB1FtcB/NZNMMtnIAiSQsBjWsAmGVWYMEAMIyKYPnyC4oegTEdwFNTOigA9E4PlEn4DgAgrC\nQxAeO4SMkR0hEIEQDDATIgSykMlk1np/1Gmmpqe679b3zsL5fV9/M3frrq6uU3XOqVOnQFEURVEU\nRVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEU\nRVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEU\nRVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEGP/MXTk/8rKFpxoCVy+ijUYaTkDXWt8TfmwCMA7qAtxvr\nW9riwtdQ16wCV66H0dA0A2ttbwUYVwWVrHQlG3xh8Z7vvtbaU4wxh1trZwbaeIcx5mHgZmvtNY31\nLW9WU